Source: duckbotos-meta
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DuckBotOS Team <duckets@duckbotos.dev>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: duckbotos-hermes
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: duckbotos-base, duckbotos-lm-studio, duckbotos-browseros, duckbotos-computer-use, duckbotos-kiosk,
         python3-pip, python3-venv, python3-yaml, python3-requests,
         curl, wget, git,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: DuckBotOS Hermes agent meta-package
 Installs Hermes (NousResearch) as the primary agent with full DuckBotOS
 stack: Hermes agent, web dashboard, LM Studio, BrowserOS, computer-use-linux,
 and Weston kiosk shell.
 .
 This is the "Hermes-only" install mode.

Package: duckbotos-openclaw
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: duckbotos-base, duckbotos-lm-studio, duckbotos-browseros, duckbotos-computer-use, duckbotos-kiosk,
         nodejs, npm,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: DuckBotOS OpenClaw agent meta-package
 Installs OpenClaw as the primary agent with full DuckBotOS stack:
 OpenClaw gateway, openclaw-os plugin, LM Studio, BrowserOS,
 computer-use-linux, and Weston kiosk shell.
 .
 This is the "OpenClaw-only" install mode.

Package: duckbotos-hybrid
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: duckbotos-base, duckbotos-lm-studio, duckbotos-browseros, duckbotos-computer-use, duckbotos-kiosk,
         duckbotos-hermes, duckbotos-openclaw,
         gdm3, gnome-session,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: DuckBotOS hybrid mode — both agents with session picker
 Installs both Hermes and OpenClaw with GDM session picker:
 Hermes Desktop, OpenClaw Desktop, Hybrid Workstation (GNOME + both panels).
 Full dual-agent experience with IPC bus and shared desktop control.
 .
 This is the "Both" install mode.

Package: duckbotos-meta
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: duckbotos-hermes
Description: DuckBotOS default meta-package
 Default DuckBotOS installation. Installs Hermes agent as the primary
 desktop environment. This is the default install mode.
 Conflicts: duckbotos-openclaw, duckbotos-hybrid
Suggests: duckbotos-docs